# __NAME__

gRPC service (`__MODULE__`) with health checking and server reflection.

```sh
go run ./cmd/server          # listens on :50051 (override with ADDR)
grpcurl -plaintext localhost:50051 list
```

Generate code from `proto/` (needs `protoc`, `protoc-gen-go`, `protoc-gen-go-grpc`):

```sh
protoc --go_out=. --go_opt=module=__MODULE__ \
       --go-grpc_out=. --go-grpc_opt=module=__MODULE__ \
       proto/greeter/v1/greeter.proto
```

then register the generated service in `cmd/server/main.go`.
